. It&#039;ll connect automatically, your=0A                                     =
               PC will download the right drivers, and you can use it right=
=0A                                                    away.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A=
=0A                                                &lt;strong&gt;=0A             =
                                       2. To connect a wireless printer, do=
wnload the latest=0A                                                    dri=
ver and software package for your printer model from=0A                    =
                                the official website and follow these steps=
:=0A                                                &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A=0A     =
                                           &lt;p&gt;a) Select the Start button, t=
hen select Settings &gt;=0A                                                   =
 Devices &gt; Printers &amp; scanners &gt; Add a printer or=0A                       =
                             scanner.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                               =
                 &lt;p&gt;b) Wait for it to find nearby printers, then choose the=
=0A                                                    one you want to use,=
 and select Add device. If you want=0A                                     =
               to remove the printer later, just highlight it and=0A       =
                                             select Remove.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A=0A=
=0A=0A                                                &lt;h3 class=3D&quot;my-4&quot;&gt;Se=
tup a New Printer (Mac)&lt;/h3&gt;=0A=0A                                         =
       &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                                    1.Pre=
pare your printer:=0A                                                &lt;/stro=
ng&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;Use the instruc=
tions that came with your printer to=0A                                    =
                unpack the printer, install ink or toner, and add paper.=0A=
                                                    Turn on the printer and=
 make sure it=E2=80=99s not displaying=0A                                  =
                  any errors.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                                    =
            &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                                    =
2. Connect your printer: Follow the instructions that=0A                   =
                                 came with the printer to connect it to the=
 network.=0A                                                &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A=
                                                &lt;p&gt;=0A                     =
                               If you have a Wi-Fi printer, you might need =
to connect=0A                                                    the printe=
r to your Mac with a USB cable to set up Wi-Fi=0A                          =
                          printing. After connecting the printer to your Ma=
c,=0A                                                    install the Mac so=
ftware that came with the printer and=0A                                   =
                 use the printer=E2=80=99s setup assistant to connect the p=
rinter=0A                                                    to your Wi-Fi =
network. After setting up, you can=0A                                      =
              disconnect the cable from your printer and Mac and the=0A    =
                                                printer should remain conne=
cted to the Wi-Fi network.=0A                                              =
  &lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;strong&gt;=0A    =
                                                3. Add the printer to your =
list of available printers:=0A                                             =
   &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;=0A   =
                                                 Choose Apple menu &gt; System=
 Settings, then click Printers=0A                                          =
          &amp; Scanners in the sidebar. (You may need to scroll=0A            =
                                        down.)&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                   =
                             &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                   =
                 4. When your printer appears in the list, select your=0A  =
                                                  printer, then click Add.=
=0A                                                &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A=0A      =
                                          &lt;p&gt; It may take a minute or two f=
or your printer to appear.=0A                                              =
      If you see a message prompting you to download new=0A                =
                                    software, make sure to download and ins=
tall it.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;stron=
g&gt;=0A                                                    5. If you do not s=
ee your printer listed on the left,=0A                                     =
               click the Add Printer, Scanner or Fax button on the=0A      =
                                              right.=0A                    =
                            &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                =
                &lt;p&gt;=0A                                                    A=
